      "id": "claim_e8a5bd4b6e744f498c782cbe8e8ad142",
      "statement": "Filesystem permission rules use first-match operation/path matching, deny either a requested path or its resolvable filesystem target, and reject an unresolvable target when rules are configured; recursive or ambiguous deletes additionally fail closed on overlapping deny patterns.",
